            "topic": "application/ segment",
            "choice": "Omitted entirely.",
            "rationale": "Deleting a listLabels/createLabel/renameLabel operation moves no policy, branching, projection, transaction intent or coordination into callers. Transport parsing, auth, row mapping, cache invalidation and a store uniqueness conflict are explicitly non-qualifying, so the sanctioned chain is channel -> server service -> private store adapter."
