          {
            "topic": "Repository port",
            "choice": "No port or repository interface; server.ts calls the Supabase store adapter directly.",
            "rationale": "Supabase/Postgres is the store and the task states no alternate provider is planned. A port would be a mirrored repository added to satisfy a template, with test mocks as the only driver."
