            "topic": "Database resource ownership",
            "choice": "Declare the labels table in rules/architecture-contract.json with labels as owner and sole consumer.",
            "rationale": "String-literal .from() calls form a second dependency graph that TypeScript imports do not reveal; the canary rejects undeclared or cross-capability access."
          }
