        "flows": [
          "RSC page read: app/(app)/labels/page.tsx → modules/labels/rsc.ts#getLabelsForRequest() → shared/server/supabase/request-session (verified actor + cookie client from one session) → server/labels-store.ts#selectLabels() → .from('labels').select(LABEL_SELECT) with tenant predicate → parse LabelRowSchema → map to Label[]; unauthenticated throws a typed failure and page.tsx calls redirect('/login') after the catch.",
